# Grid Pulse — project

- Goal: real-time power grid anomaly detection (pandapower + measurement-fault MVP).
- Checkout: `~/dev/personal/gridpulse`. Local commits only; no remote push until asked.
- Stage order: 0 scaffold → 1 network → 2 telemetry → 3 quality gate → 4 powerflow → 5 anomaly → 6 pipeline → 7 UI → 8 hardening.
- Locked decisions live in Project store `docs/project-context.md` / `preferences.md`. Do not reopen without plan revision.
- Default network: IEEE case14 via pluggable `load_network`. Anomalies: measurement faults only; reserve room for future `pf_residual`. Discrete offline batch ticks. Hard-skip PF on any quality failure.
